==Trivia==
*The 2017 and 2018 April Fools' articles are the only ones to be available in English.
*The 2023 article poster is based off of [[wikipedia:The Super Mario Bros. Movie|The Super Mario Bros. Movie]].
*According to the intro, Into the Future takes place on April 1st.
*The Japanese version of the April Fools' 2017 article features a joke about [[wikipedia:Trump wall|the wall]] on America and Mexico's border being made of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]], but this joke is absent in the English version, likely to prevent outrage.
*The [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event|Bikkuriman Collaboration]] was advertised a few weeks before its initial release in Ponos' 2019 April Fools' article.

